; GS Quant Architect v4.00 - Optimizer Pass 3 (Market Conditions)
; Load in MT5 Strategy Tester -> Inputs -> Load
; Entry + exit engine is LOCKED from pass-1/pass-2 winners.
; Only market-condition filters are optimized in this pass (marked with ...||Y).
;
; Format:
; parameter=value||start||step||stop||optimize

InpMagicNumber=20260306||20260306||1||20260306||N
InpTradeComment=GSQ4_OPT_P3||GSQ4_OPT_P3||0||GSQ4_OPT_P3||N
InpDebugMode=false||false||0||true||N
InpLogTrades=false||false||0||true||N

; ===== Pass 3 optimization core (market conditions) =====
